       <text:p text:style-name="P8">Mill Valley Pasta Company <text:span text:style-name="T21">Factory Store</text:span>, San Rafael, Way in Back Next to Pho Viet, 555 Francisco Blvd E suite 24, San Rafael, CA 94901, (415) 755-4186, <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://millvalleypasta.com/contact" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T22">Contact</text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T22">,</text:span> <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.yelp.com/biz/mill-valley-pasta-san-rafael-2" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T22">Yelp</text:span></text:a>: Mill Valley Pasta Co. is a small artisan pasta producer specializing in dried pastas, pasta sauces, non-dried (fresh) pastas, and pasta-adjacent provisions. </text:p>
